msgctxt "acc_delete_confirm"
msgid ""
"Permanently delete the account \"{name}\" and all its data? This cannot be "
"undone."
msgstr ""
"Trwale usunąć konto \"{name}\" i wszystkie jego dane? Tej operacji nie można"
" cofnąć."

