msgctxt "startup_account_not_answering"
msgid ""
"This WinZapp account is already running but did not answer, possibly because"
" it is still closing. Wait a few seconds and open it again. If it keeps "
"happening, end WinZapp.exe in Task Manager and open WinZapp again."
msgstr ""
"To konto WinZapp jest już uruchomione, ale nie odpowiedziało; być może nadal"
" się zamyka. Poczekaj kilka sekund i otwórz je ponownie. Jeśli to się "
