"WinZapp encountered a critical error during startup and could not continue.\n"
"\n"
"Details were saved to:\n"
"{path}\n"
"\n"
"{details}"
msgstr ""
"Podczas uruchamiania WinZapp wystąpił błąd krytyczny i program nie może kontynuować.\n"
"\n"
"Szczegóły zapisano w:\n"
"{path}\n"
"\n"
"{details}"

